  "about": "Share this server (docs/share-a-server.md). Every platform must: derive every value in `keys` from the two UMK seeds and the secret; build each envelope's canonical string from `fields` and reproduce the Ed25519 signature with the named signer (owner = IRK of ownerUmkSeedHex standing in for the sensitive key, member = deriveShareMemberKey(memberUmk, shareId), inbox = deriveShareInboxKey(memberUmk)); `push` and `update` are #10 and #11, and each `pushTokens` sha256 is shareSha256Hex(token); refuse every `refuse` case; fail to verify every `reject` case against the named public key; AES-256-GCM-seal each `sealed` plaintext (exact UTF-8 bytes) with the key, nonce and AAD to the given hex, and open it back; build and parse the links. Label length counts Unicode code points.",
